tionKey":"/books/OL28291418M","isbn13":"9789022537336","checkedAt":"2026-11-03T09:26:38.922Z","note":"Exact bound bulk source attempt retained. No image claimedverifiedorimported; preserve current resolver. Require decodedexactfront or documentedneutralplaceholder in hostedacceptance; noEnglishsubstitution.","attempts":[{"receipt":"cover-archive-v2-readback.json","coverId":15168491,"status":"bulk_archive_unavailable","receiptSha256":"4d3654aabbd278b441113fd2849c2921b159283130e3ff174337511c4b78ce11"}],"limitation":"No verified image is imported. Existing neutral placeholder; not proof that no cover exists at the provider or elsewhere."}],"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-03T09:26:38.922Z","review_batch":"nl-scale-20261102-047"}},{"ref":"d1","relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","key":{"work_id":987146024,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":987146024,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":987304010,"text":"De spanningen tussen de vier kattenclans nemen toe en de voorspelling die drie jonge katten verbindt, is nog niet opgehelderd. Een oproep om hulp uit de bergen biedt mogelijk nieuwe antwoorden. Terwijl één van hen de eigen clan tegen verdere strijd probeert te beschermen, vertrekt een ander naar de stam die daar leeft. Hun zoektocht brengt de geschiedenis van de clans en die van de bergkatten dichter bij elkaar. Tegelijk blijft onzeker of de bekende regels voldoende bescherming bieden tegen de groeiende dreiging.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_url":"https://openlibrary.org/works/OL17455355W","evidence":[{"type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p420855408"],"checked_at":"2026-11-03T09:26:38.922Z","reference":"work:3394","note":"Retain existing Work3394 Sign of the Moon / Erin Hunter and exact Dutch Spoor van de maan 9789059245983 hardcover. KB original-title/volume and existing source-edition parent compared; original conten