-archive-v2-readback.json","coverId":15130839,"status":"bulk_archive_unavailable","receiptSha256":"4d3654aabbd278b441113fd2849c2921b159283130e3ff174337511c4b78ce11"}],"limitation":"No verified image is imported. Existing neutral placeholder; not proof that no cover exists at the provider or elsewhere."}],"review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-03T09:26:38.922Z","review_batch":"nl-scale-20261102-047"}},{"ref":"d9","relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","key":{"work_id":987146004,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":987146004,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":987304006,"text":"Heaven Casteel groeit met haar broers en zussen op in armoede in de bergen. Ondanks de vernederingen rond haar gezin probeert zij vast te houden aan de verwachting dat de kinderen later een ander leven kunnen krijgen. Hun vader is hard en hun stiefmoeder overbelast. Wanneer die laatste vertrekt, wordt hun toch al onzekere bestaan nog kwetsbaarder. Een plan van hun vader bedreigt vervolgens wat Heaven voor zichzelf en de anderen had gehoopt. Dit eerste Casteel-deel volgt haar strijd om waardigheid en een toekomst.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_url":"https://openlibrary.org/works/OL134889W","evidence":[{"type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p371618061","http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p852125623"],"checked_at":"2026-11-03T09:26:38.922Z","reference":"work:2653","note":"Retain existing Work2653 Heaven / V.C. Andrews and exact Dutch Hemel zonder Engelen 9789032502645 Paperback. KB original-title/volume and existing source-edition parent compared; original content review content-review-024.json retained. No abridgment, omnibus or translated-title duplication established for this selected edition. This changes presentation metadata/summary only; do not claim additionalDutchavailability.","canonical_name_resolution":null},{"type":"original_substantive_source