 daarvan te herstellen ontbreekt. De verdediging vraagt samenwerking tussen magiërs, strijders en andere betrokkenen die niet allemaal dezelfde achtergrond of bedoelingen hebben.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_url":"https://openlibrary.org/works/OL15171940W","evidence":[{"type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p322873908"],"checked_at":"2026-11-03T09:26:38.922Z","reference":"work:5904","note":"Retain existing Work5904 At the Gates of Darkness / Raymond E. Feist and exact Dutch Voor de poorten van het duister 9789024528899 Hardcover. KB original-title/volume and existing source-edition parent compared; original content review content-review-025.json retained. No abridgment, omnibus or translated-title duplication established for this selected edition. This changes presentation metadata/summary only; do not claim additionalDutchavailability.","canonical_name_resolution":null},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-025.json","sources":["https://openlibrary.org/works/OL15171940W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p322873908"]},{"type":"no_verified_cover_asset_retained","status":"no_verified_asset_retained","editionKey":"/books/OL61291383M","isbn13":"9789024528899","checkedAt":"2026-11-03T09:26:38.922Z","note":"Exact bound bulk source attempt retained. No image claimedverifiedorimported; preserve current resolver. Require decodedexactfront or documentedneutralplaceholder in hostedacceptance; noEnglishsubstitution.","attempts":[{"receipt":"cover-archive-v2-readback.json","coverId":15169169,"status":"bulk_archive_unavailable","receiptSha256":"4d3654aabbd278b441113fd2849c2921b159283130e3ff174337511c4b78ce11"}],"limitation":"No verified image is imported. Existing neutral placeholder; not proof that no cover exists at the provider or elsewhere."}],"provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","review_status":"approved","re