 jongen. Ze denkt dat ze dit geheim voor zichzelf moet houden. Wanneer de klas een toneelstuk over het spinnenweb van Charlotte gaat opvoeren, wil ze graag Charlotte spelen. De leerkracht sluit die mogelijkheid echter uit. Met haar vriendin Kelly zoekt ze een manier om toch te laten zien wie ze is. Het verhaal draait om erkenning, vriendschap en de ruimte om zelf over je identiteit te spreken.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_url":"https://openlibrary.org/works/OL17334061W","evidence":[{"type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p402364562","http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p437039455"],"checked_at":"2026-11-03T09:26:38.922Z","reference":"work:3412","note":"Retain existing Work3412 Melissa / Alex Gino and exact Dutch George 9789020674460 Hardcover. KB original-title/volume and existing source-edition parent compared; original content review content-review-025.json retained. Current Work title Melissa and original Dutch edition title George refer to same book. Preserve exact edition title without misgendering protagonist or inferring a second Work. This changes presentation metadata/summary only; do not claim additionalDutchavailability.","canonical_name_resolution":null},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-025.json","sources":["https://openlibrary.org/works/OL17334061W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p402364562","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p437039455"]},{"type":"no_verified_cover_asset_retained","status":"no_verified_asset_retained","editionKey":"/books/OL60578397M","isbn13":"9789020674460","checkedAt":"2026-11-03T09:26:38.922Z","note":"Exact bound bulk source attempt retained. No image claimedverifiedorimported; preserve current resolver. Require decodedexactfront or documentedneutralplaceholder in hostedacceptance; noEnglishsubstitution.","attempts":[{"receipt":"cover-archive-v2-readback.json","coverId