ert als jonge promovendus haar richting te vinden en voelt zich aangetrokken tot Conor Harkness, de oudere beste vriend van haar broer. Hij houdt afstand omdat hun omstandigheden en de machtsverhouding volgens hem te veel verschillen. Bij de bruiloft van Maya''s broer op Sicilië verblijven ze echter ruim een week samen met de andere gasten. Die nabijheid maakt hun eerdere grenzen minder vanzelfsprekend. Terwijl de trouwplannen ontsporen, moet Maya bepalen wat zij werkelijk van Conor wil en wat hij zelf achterhoudt.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_url":"https://openlibrary.org/works/OL43548572W","evidence":[{"type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p44471510X"],"checked_at":"2026-11-03T09:26:38.922Z","reference":"work:3522","note":"Retain existing Work3522 Problematic Summer Romance / Ali Hazelwood and exact Dutch Problematic Summer Romance 9789000400973 Paperback. KB original-title/volume and existing source-edition parent compared; original content review content-review-026.json retained. No abridgment, omnibus or translated-title duplication established for this selected edition. This changes presentation metadata/summary only; do not claim additionalDutchavailability.","canonical_name_resolution":null},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-026.json","sources":["https://openlibrary.org/works/OL43548572W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p44471510X"]},{"type":"no_verified_cover_asset_retained","status":"no_verified_asset_retained","editionKey":"/books/OL61200458M","isbn13":"9789000400973","checkedAt":"2026-11-03T09:26:38.922Z","note":"Exact bound bulk source attempt retained. No image claimedverifiedorimported; preserve current resolver. Require decodedexactfront or documentedneutralplaceholder in hostedacceptance; noEnglishsubstitution.","attempts":[{"receipt":"cover-archive-v2-readback.json","coverId":15165839,"s