age":"nl","bound_author_id":987346018,"text":"In augustus 1975 ontdekt een begeleider op een zomerkamp in de Adirondacks dat Barbara Van Laar niet in haar bed ligt. De dertienjarige is de dochter van de familie die het kamp bezit en veel mensen uit de streek werk geeft. Jaren eerder verdween ook haar broer, zonder te worden teruggevonden. De nieuwe zoektocht roept oude vragen op en maakt de verschillen tussen de familie en haar omgeving voelbaar. Liz Moore verweeft de geheimen van de eigenaren met die van de mensen die in hun schaduw leven.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_url":"https://openlibrary.org/works/OL37827517W","evidence":[{"type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["http://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p442224044"],"checked_at":"2026-11-03T09:26:38.922Z","reference":"work:3549","note":"Retain existing Work3549 The God of the Woods / Liz Moore and exact Dutch De stem uit het bos 9789028453524 Paperback. KB original-title/volume and existing source-edition parent compared; original content review content-review-027.json retained. No abridgment, omnibus or translated-title duplication established for this selected edition. This changes presentation metadata/summary only; do not claim additionalDutchavailability.","canonical_name_resolution":null},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-027.json","sources":["https://openlibrary.org/works/OL37827517W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p442224044"]},{"type":"no_verified_cover_asset_retained","status":"no_verified_asset_retained","editionKey":"/books/OL60693623M","isbn13":"9789028453524","checkedAt":"2026-11-03T09:26:38.922Z","note":"Exact bound bulk source attempt retained. No image claimedverifiedorimported; preserve current resolver. Require decodedexactfront or documentedneutralplaceholder in hostedacceptance; noEnglishsubstitution.","attempts":[{"receipt":"cover-archive-v2-readback.json","coverId":15